        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use chess pieces as golf clubs to try and find the hole in a fog-covered golf course. But watch out for hazards like bunkers or water. Can you stay under par?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><br>FOGGY Golf is</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One Part Golf</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One Part Chess</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One Part Minesweeper (Sort Of)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and One Part Wordle (Kind Of)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And now it's available on Steam!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New Course Every Day</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Backlog of Past Courses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stats Tracking and Sharing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Free!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No Really, it's Free. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No Un-skippable Video Ads</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No Microtransactions.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4158380/extras/a4329672c9371d76e8e7ca3fc2bfa91c.poster.avif?t=1764089999\" width=548 height=722 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4158380/extras/a4329672c9371d76e8e7ca3fc2bfa91c.webm?t=1764089999\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
